mad</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/of-motes-beams-and-holy-wars.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2255291888473388413' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2255291888473388413' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-190856306"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 18, 2010 at 9:54 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3636631546054456799</id><published>2010-08-18T09:52:07.131-06:00</published><updated>2010-08-18T09:52:07.131-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s the normal wailing and gnashing of teeth ...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s the normal wailing and gnashing of teeth from the usual suspects. God&amp;#39;s so-called &amp;quot;Chosen&amp;quot; people are good at that.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2255291888473388413/comments/default/3636631546054456799'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2255291888473388413/comments/default/3636631546054456799'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/of-motes-beams-and-holy-wars.html?showComment=1282146727131#c3636631546054456799' title=''/><author><name>Saladin</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09930510353343780782</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='27' src='http://bp1.blogger.com/_3nm82BZKt8w/SGV-ZNce_fI/AAAAAAAAABE/ea2m8hZnrRw/S220/Help+child.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/of-motes-beams-and-holy-wars.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2255291888473388413' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2255291888473388413' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-376846434"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 18, 2010 at 9:52 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4376072705328039825</id><published>2010-08-18T06:11:52.549-06:00</published><updated>2010-08-18T06:11:52.549-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&amp;#39;s a paradigm shattering argument against th...</title><content type='html'>It&amp;#39;s a paradigm shattering argument against the xenophobic war mongerers. I do believe that some people might actually short circuit and we may see several explosions here in the US of many neocon&amp;#39;s heads. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Unfortunately so, it will most likely be met with denial and &amp;quot;shut up liberal&amp;quot; from anyone who is posed with this great facet of irony.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2255291888473388413/comments/default/4376072705328039825'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2255291888473388413/comments/default/4376072705328039825'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/of-motes-beams-and-holy-wars.html?showComment=1282133512549#c4376072705328039825' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/08/of-motes-beams-and-holy-wars.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2255291888473388413' source='http://www.blogger.com/feed